  },
  {
   "id": "da0703:T00169",
   "source_sha256": "0c409eeee50d2cee58d2cd6ced90048f855acf1944ae630445d89c44aa2376a9",
   "ko": " 집어삼키고, 쿠자쿠를\n쳐부수어, "
  },
  {
